[
  {
    "content_id": "10060001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶稣基督的使徒彼得写信给那分散在本都、加拉太、加帕多家、亚细亚、庇推尼寄居的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;就是照父　神的先见被拣选，借着圣灵得成圣洁，以致顺服耶稣基督，又蒙他血所洒的人。愿恩惠、平安多多地加给你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;愿颂赞归与我们主耶稣基督的父　神！他曾照自己的大怜悯，借耶稣基督从死里复活，重生了我们，叫我们有活泼的盼望，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;可以得着不能朽坏、不能玷污、不能衰残、为你们存留在天上的基业。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们这因信蒙　神能力保守的人，必能得着所预备、到末世要显现的救恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;因此，你们是大有喜乐；但如今，在百般的试炼中暂时忧愁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;叫你们的信心既被试验，就比那被火试验仍然能坏的金子更显宝贵，可以在耶稣基督显现的时候得着称赞、荣耀、尊贵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们虽然没有见过他，却是爱他；如今虽不得看见，却因信他就有说不出来、满有荣光的大喜乐；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;并且得着你们信心的果效，就是灵魂的救恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;论到这救恩，那预先说你们要得恩典的众先知早已详细地寻求考察，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;就是考察在他们心里基督的灵，预先证明基督受苦难，后来得荣耀，是指着什么时候，并怎样的时候。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他们得了启示，知道他们所传讲的一切事，不是为自己，乃是为你们。那靠着从天上差来的圣灵传福音给你们的人，现在将这些事报给你们；天使也愿意详细察看这些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;所以要约束你们的心，谨慎自守，专心盼望耶稣基督显现的时候所带来给你们的恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们既作顺命的儿女，就不要效法从前蒙昧无知的时候那放纵私欲的样子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;那召你们的既是圣洁，你们在一切所行的事上也要圣洁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因为经上记着说：「你们要圣洁，因为我是圣洁的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你们既称那不偏待人、按各人行为审判人的主为父，就当存敬畏的心度你们在世寄居的日子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;知道你们得赎，脱去你们祖宗所传流虚妄的行为，不是凭着能坏的金银等物，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;乃是凭着基督的宝血，如同无瑕疵、无玷污的羔羊之血。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;基督在创世以前是预先被　神知道的，却在这末世才为你们显现。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你们也因着他，信那叫他从死里复活、又给他荣耀的　神，叫你们的信心和盼望都在于　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你们既因顺从真理，洁净了自己的心，以致爱弟兄没有虚假，就当从心里彼此切实相爱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;你们蒙了重生，不是由于能坏的种子，乃是由于不能坏的种子，是借着　神活泼常存的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;因为 凡有血气的，尽都如草； 他的美荣都像草上的花。 草必枯干，花必凋谢；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;惟有主的道是永存的。 所传给你们的福音就是这道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;所以，你们既除去一切的恶毒、诡诈，并假善、嫉妒，和一切毁谤的话，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;就要爱慕那纯净的灵奶，像才生的婴孩爱慕奶一样，叫你们因此渐长，以致得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们若尝过主恩的滋味，就必如此。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;主乃活石，固然是被人所弃的，却是被　神所拣选、所宝贵的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们来到主面前，也就像活石，被建造成为灵宫，作圣洁的祭司，借着耶稣基督奉献　神所悦纳的灵祭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;因为经上说： 看哪，我把所拣选、 所宝贵的房角石安放在锡安； 信靠他的人必不至于羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;所以，他在你们信的人就为宝贵，在那不信的人有话说： 匠人所弃的石头 已作了房角的头块石头。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;又说：作了绊脚的石头，跌人的磐石。他们既不顺从，就在道理上绊跌；他们这样绊跌也是预定的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;惟有你们是被拣选的族类，是有君尊的祭司，是圣洁的国度，是属　神的子民，要叫你们宣扬那召你们出黑暗入奇妙光明者的美德。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你们从前算不得子民， 现在却作了　神的子民； 从前未曾蒙怜恤， 现在却蒙了怜恤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄啊，你们是客旅，是寄居的。我劝你们要禁戒肉体的私欲；这私欲是与灵魂争战的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你们在外邦人中，应当品行端正，叫那些毁谤你们是作恶的，因看见你们的好行为，便在鉴察的日子归荣耀给　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们为主的缘故，要顺服人的一切制度，或是在上的君王，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;或是君王所派罚恶赏善的臣宰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;因为　神的旨意原是要你们行善，可以堵住那糊涂无知人的口。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你们虽是自由的，却不可借着自由遮盖恶毒，总要作　神的仆人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;务要尊敬众人，亲爱教中的弟兄，敬畏　神，尊敬君王。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你们作仆人的，凡事要存敬畏的心顺服主人；不但顺服那善良温和的，就是那乖僻的也要顺服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;倘若人为叫良心对得住　神，就忍受冤屈的苦楚，这是可喜爱的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;你们若因犯罪受责打，能忍耐，有什么可夸的呢？但你们若因行善受苦，能忍耐，这在　神看是可喜爱的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你们蒙召原是为此；因基督也为你们受过苦，给你们留下榜样，叫你们跟随他的脚踪行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;他并没有犯罪，口里也没有诡诈。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;他被骂不还口；受害不说威吓的话，只将自己交托那按公义审判人的主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;他被挂在木头上，亲身担当了我们的罪，使我们既然在罪上死，就得以在义上活。因他受的鞭伤，你们便得了医治。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;你们从前好像迷路的羊，如今却归到你们灵魂的牧人监督了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你们作妻子的要顺服自己的丈夫；这样，若有不信从道理的丈夫，他们虽然不听道，也可以因妻子的品行被感化过来；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;这正是因看见你们有贞洁的品行和敬畏的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们不要以外面的辫头发，戴金饰，穿美衣为妆饰，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;只要以里面存着长久温柔、安静的心为妆饰；这在　神面前是极宝贵的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;因为古时仰赖　神的圣洁妇人正是以此为妆饰，顺服自己的丈夫，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;就如撒拉听从亚伯拉罕，称他为主。你们若行善，不因恐吓而害怕，便是撒拉的女儿了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你们作丈夫的也要按情理和妻子同住；因她比你软弱，与你一同承受生命之恩的，所以要敬重她。这样，便叫你们的祷告没有阻碍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;总而言之，你们都要同心，彼此体恤，相爱如弟兄，存慈怜谦卑的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;不以恶报恶，以辱骂还辱骂，倒要祝福；因你们是为此蒙召，好叫你们承受福气。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因为经上说： 人若爱生命， 愿享美福， 须要禁止舌头不出恶言， 嘴唇不说诡诈的话；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;也要离恶行善， 寻求和睦，一心追赶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;因为，主的眼看顾义人； 主的耳听他们的祈祷。 惟有行恶的人，主向他们变脸。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们若是热心行善，有谁害你们呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们就是为义受苦，也是有福的。不要怕人的威吓，也不要惊慌；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;只要心里尊主基督为圣。有人问你们心中盼望的缘由，就要常作准备，以温柔、敬畏的心回答各人；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;存着无亏的良心，叫你们在何事上被毁谤，就在何事上可以叫那诬赖你们在基督里有好品行的人自觉羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;神的旨意若是叫你们因行善受苦，总强如因行恶受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;因基督也曾一次为罪受苦，就是义的代替不义的，为要引我们到　神面前。按着肉体说，他被治死；按着灵性说，他复活了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;他借这灵曾去传道给那些在监狱里的灵听，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;就是那从前在挪亚预备方舟、　神容忍等待的时候，不信从的人。当时进入方舟，借着水得救的不多，只有八个人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;这水所表明的洗礼，现在借着耶稣基督复活也拯救你们；这洗礼本不在乎除掉肉体的污秽，只求在　神面前有无亏的良心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;耶稣已经进入天堂，在　神的右边；众天使和有权柄的，并有能力的，都服从了他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;基督既在肉身受苦，你们也当将这样的心志作为兵器，因为在肉身受过苦的，就已经与罪断绝了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们存这样的心，从今以后就可以不从人的情欲，只从　神的旨意在世度余下的光阴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因为往日随从外邦人的心意行邪淫、恶欲、醉酒、荒宴、群饮，并可恶拜偶像的事，时候已经够了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他们在这些事上，见你们不与他们同奔那放荡无度的路，就以为怪，毁谤你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;他们必在那将要审判活人死人的主面前交帐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;为此，就是死人也曾有福音传给他们，要叫他们的肉体按着人受审判，他们的灵性却靠　神活着。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;万物的结局近了。所以，你们要谨慎自守，警醒祷告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;最要紧的是彼此切实相爱，因为爱能遮掩许多的罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你们要互相款待，不发怨言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;各人要照所得的恩赐彼此服事，作　神百般恩赐的好管家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;若有讲道的，要按着　神的圣言讲；若有服事人的，要按着　神所赐的力量服事，叫　神在凡事上因耶稣基督得荣耀。原来荣耀、权能都是他的，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄啊，有火炼的试验临到你们，不要以为奇怪（似乎是遭遇非常的事），</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;倒要欢喜；因为你们是与基督一同受苦，使你们在他荣耀显现的时候，也可以欢喜快乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们若为基督的名受辱骂，便是有福的；因为　神荣耀的灵常住在你们身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你们中间却不可有人因为杀人、偷窃、作恶、好管闲事而受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;若为作基督徒受苦，却不要羞耻，倒要因这名归荣耀给　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;因为时候到了，审判要从　神的家起首。若是先从我们起首，那不信从　神福音的人将有何等的结局呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;若是义人仅仅得救，那不虔敬和犯罪的人将有何地可站呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;所以，那照　神旨意受苦的人要一心为善，将自己灵魂交与那信实的造化之主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我这作长老、作基督受苦的见证、同享后来所要显现之荣耀的，劝你们中间与我同作长老的人：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;务要牧养在你们中间　神的群羊，按着　神旨意照管他们；不是出于勉强，乃是出于甘心；也不是因为贪财，乃是出于乐意；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;也不是辖制所托付你们的，乃是作群羊的榜样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;到了牧长显现的时候，你们必得那永不衰残的荣耀冠冕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们年幼的，也要顺服年长的。就是你们众人也都要以谦卑束腰，彼此顺服；因为 　神阻挡骄傲的人， 赐恩给谦卑的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;所以，你们要自卑，服在　神大能的手下，到了时候，他必叫你们升高。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你们要将一切的忧虑卸给　神，因为他顾念你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;务要谨守，警醒。因为你们的仇敌魔鬼，如同吼叫的狮子，遍地游行，寻找可吞吃的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你们要用坚固的信心抵挡他，因为知道你们在世上的众弟兄也是经历这样的苦难。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;那赐诸般恩典的　神曾在基督里召你们，得享他永远的荣耀，等你们暂受苦难之后，必要亲自成全你们，坚固你们，赐力量给你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;愿权能归给他，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我略略地写了这信，托我所看为忠心的兄弟西拉转交你们，劝勉你们，又证明这恩是　神的真恩。你们务要在这恩上站立得住。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;在巴比伦与你们同蒙拣选的教会问你们安。我儿子马可也问你们安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们要用爱心彼此亲嘴问安。愿平安归与你们凡在基督里的人！</p>"
  }
]